---
const groups = [
  {
    title: "Before you book",
    items: [
      "Confirm your visa: China currently offers visa-free entry to 76 countries and a 240-hour transit visa-free policy for 55 countries, including via Guilin and Nanning. Check your nationality first.",
      "Book the Li River cruise (4-star CNY 350-500) a day ahead in peak season, ideally through your guesthouse.",
      "Reserve a night on Longji's terraces if you want the sunrise; same-day day-trips miss it.",
    ],
  },
  {
    title: "Before you fly",
    items: [
      "Set up Alipay or WeChat Pay and link a card. Mobile payment is standard everywhere.",
      "Download an offline translation app (Google Translate offline or Pleco) and save screenshots of addresses and dish names.",
      "Carry some cash for villages in Hechi and Longji, where ATMs are scarce.",
    ],
  },
  {
    title: "On the road",
    items: [
      "Pack grippy shoes for Longji's stairs and Huangyao's cobblestones, plus rain gear for the May-to-August wet season.",
      "Bring motion-sickness medicine for the Beihai-Weizhou ferry, which is rough in wind.",
      "Keep your passport handy in border areas, and stay within marked tourist zones.",
    ],
  },
];
---
<section id="checklist" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 pb-1">
        The pre-trip checklist
      </h2>
      <p class="text-stone-500 text-lg mt-4 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Nine things that prevent most first-trip hiccups. Tick them off and the rest is scenery.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      {groups.map((g) => (
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-700 mb-4">{g.title}</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            {g.items.map((it) => (
              <li class="flex gap-3 items-start">
                <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-4 h-4 accent-brand-700 shrink-0" />
                <span class="text-stone-700 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">{it}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
